---
config:
  class:
    useMaxWidth: false
title: Simple Task - Process Model
---
classDiagram
    direction TB
    class SimpleTask {
        +String id
        +String description
        +String input
        +String output
        +TaskState state
        +request()
        +start_work()
        +complete()
        +continue_work()
        +close()
        +cancel()
    }
    class TaskState {
        <<enumeration>>
        new
        requested
        work_in_progress
        complete
        closed
        cancelled
    }
    class Requester {
        +createTask()
        +request()
        +continue_work()
        +close()
        +cancel()
    }
    class Fulfiller {
        +start_work()
        +complete()
    }
    class Manager {
        +request()
        +start_work()
        +complete()
        +continue_work()
        +close()
        +cancel()
    }
    class CompletionEvidence {
        +String results
        +String documentation
    }
    SimpleTask --> TaskState : current state
    Requester --> SimpleTask : requests and confirms
    Fulfiller --> SimpleTask : delivers
    Manager --> SimpleTask : oversees all transitions
    SimpleTask "1" *-- "0..*" CompletionEvidence : documents
    note for SimpleTask "Initial state: new\nTerminal states: closed, cancelled"
    note for Requester "Cancel only from requested or work_in_progress\nContinue and close only from complete"
    note for Fulfiller "Start only from requested\nComplete only from work_in_progress"
